y, taking a wider and much longer line to the left side of the fence."] "\n\n" [:p {} "German " [:a {:href "/athletes/12798"} "Ludwig Stubbendorff"] " took a big lead in the opening dressage and extended it in the cross-country by winning that phase, meaning he basically only had to stay upright in the jumping to win the gold medal, and he did so comfortably. Silver went to American " [:a {:href "/athletes/12849"} "Earl Thomson"] " aboard " [:a {:href "/horses/1261"} [:em {} "Jenny Camp"]] ", repeating their finish together at " [:a {:href "/results/185082"} "Los Angeles in 1932"] ". Thomson performed poorly in the dressage and was well behind, but placed fifth in cross-country, and was equal fourth in the jumping to secure his silver medal. Danish riders placed third and fourth, with " [:a {:href "/athletes/12342"} "Hans Lunding"] " winning the bronze medal ahead of his teammate " [:a {:href "/athletes/12046"} "Vincens Grandjean"] "."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "Horse"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/12798"} "Ludwig Stubbendorff"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/1788"} "Nurmi"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "-37.70"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/12849"} "Earl Thomson"]] [:td {} [:i {} [:a {:href "/horses/1261"} "Jenny Camp"]]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "-99.90"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} 